{"id":"958f628ab7b9bea6","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-number-on-forehead.md","title":"Number-on-Forehead Communication and Cylinders","display":"df-number-on-forehead — Number-on-Forehead Communication and Cylinders","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-number-on-forehead","aliases":["28-df-number-on-forehead"],"display":"df-number-on-forehead — Number-on-Forehead Communication and Cylinders","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §13.3 and cylinder-intersection formulation","source_printed_pages":"278–279","source_pdf_pages":"304–305","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-number-on-forehead"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-number-on-forehead</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-number-on-forehead — Number-on-Forehead Communication and Cylinders"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §13.3 and cylinder-intersection formulation"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"278–279"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"304–305"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2},n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2},n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i=\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(X_i=\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[k]\">\\(i\\in[k]\\)</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega=\\prod_{i=1}^kX_i\">\\(\\Omega=\\prod_{i=1}^kX_i\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_{-i}\">\\(x_{-i}\\)</span> 为删去第i分量的元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Omega\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\Omega\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\preceq s\">\\(h\\preceq s\\)</span> 表示前缀，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为空串。</li>\n<li>协议候选是完整元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi=(T,\\lambda,a)\">\\(\\Pi=(T,\\lambda,a)\\)</span>；各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_h\">\\(a_h\\)</span> 为从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{j\\in[k]\\setminus\\{\\lambda(h)\\}}X_j\">\\(\\prod_{j\\in[k]\\setminus\\{\\lambda(h)\\}}X_j\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 的函数；叶输出为公开历史最后一位，计入通信。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>执行递归和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_\\Pi\">\\(t_\\Pi\\)</span> 仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi\\in\\mathscr P_{k,n}\">\\(\\Pi\\in\\mathscr P_{k,n}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\Omega\">\\(x\\in\\Omega\\)</span> 定义；历史比特按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 起始编号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L(T)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in T:h0\\notin T\\land h1\\notin T\\},\\qquad J(T)\\coloneqq T\\setminus L(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L(T)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in T:h0\\notin T\\land h1\\notin T\\},\\qquad J(T)\\coloneqq T\\setminus L(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathscr P_{k,n}\\coloneqq\\{(T,\\lambda,a):\\;&amp;T\\subseteq\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega},\\ |T|&lt;\\aleph_0,\\ \\epsilon\\in T\\setminus L(T),\\ \\forall s\\in T\\ \\forall h\\preceq s\\ h\\in T,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall h\\in J(T)\\ \\{h0,h1\\}\\subseteq T,\\ \\lambda:J(T)\\to[k],\\ a\\in\\prod_{h\\in J(T)}\\Sigma^{\\prod_{j\\in[k]\\setminus\\{\\lambda(h)\\}}X_j}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathscr P_{k,n}\\coloneqq\\{(T,\\lambda,a):\\;&amp;T\\subseteq\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega},\\ |T|&lt;\\aleph_0,\\ \\epsilon\\in T\\setminus L(T),\\ \\forall s\\in T\\ \\forall h\\preceq s\\ h\\in T,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall h\\in J(T)\\ \\{h0,h1\\}\\subseteq T,\\ \\lambda:J(T)\\to[k],\\ a\\in\\prod_{h\\in J(T)}\\Sigma^{\\prod_{j\\in[k]\\setminus\\{\\lambda(h)\\}}X_j}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h_0^{\\Pi,x}\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad h_{t+1}^{\\Pi,x}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}h_t^{\\Pi,x}&amp;h_t^{\\Pi,x}\\in L(T),\\\\h_t^{\\Pi,x}a_{h_t^{\\Pi,x}}(x_{-\\lambda(h_t^{\\Pi,x})})&amp;h_t^{\\Pi,x}\\in J(T).\\end{cases}\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad t_\\Pi(x)\\coloneqq\\min\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:h_t^{\\Pi,x}\\in L(T)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h_0^{\\Pi,x}\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad h_{t+1}^{\\Pi,x}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}h_t^{\\Pi,x}&amp;h_t^{\\Pi,x}\\in L(T),\\\\h_t^{\\Pi,x}a_{h_t^{\\Pi,x}}(x_{-\\lambda(h_t^{\\Pi,x})})&amp;h_t^{\\Pi,x}\\in J(T).\\end{cases}\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad t_\\Pi(x)\\coloneqq\\min\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:h_t^{\\Pi,x}\\in L(T)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_k(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\max_{x\\in\\Omega}t_\\Pi(x):\\Pi\\in\\mathscr P_{k,n},\\ \\forall x\\in\\Omega\\ (h_{t_\\Pi(x)}^{\\Pi,x})_{t_\\Pi(x)}=f(x)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_k(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\max_{x\\in\\Omega}t_\\Pi(x):\\Pi\\in\\mathscr P_{k,n},\\ \\forall x\\in\\Omega\\ (h_{t_\\Pi(x)}^{\\Pi,x})_{t_\\Pi(x)}=f(x)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_i\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq\\Omega:\\forall x\\in S\\ \\forall z\\in X_i\\ (x_1,\\ldots,x_{i-1},z,x_{i+1},\\ldots,x_k)\\in S\\}\\quad(i\\in[k]),\\qquad\\mathcal{CI}\\coloneqq\\{\\bigcap_{i=1}^kS_i:S_i\\in\\mathcal C_i\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C_i\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq\\Omega:\\forall x\\in S\\ \\forall z\\in X_i\\ (x_1,\\ldots,x_{i-1},z,x_{i+1},\\ldots,x_k)\\in S\\}\\quad(i\\in[k]),\\qquad\\mathcal{CI}\\coloneqq\\{\\bigcap_{i=1}^kS_i:S_i\\in\\mathcal C_i\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>发位函数明确不能访问自己的第i输入，但能访问全部公共历史；有限树保证递归终止。另一玩家先公开某一输入，再由缺该输入的玩家给答案，说明正确候选存在。柱集和柱交集在相同输入积Ω上定义，不暗借两方矩形。</p>\n<p>来源：§13.3 and cylinder-intersection formulation；印刷页 278–279；PDF 页 304–305。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第13章的 Number-on-Forehead Communication and Cylinders，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n<p>本次形式修补：到达叶节点后历史保持原值；停止时刻仍是第一次到叶的时刻，不改变末位输出计费或各方可见输入范围。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2},n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"X_i=\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in[k]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega=\\prod_{i=1}^kX_i","display":false},{"tex":"x_{-i}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\Omega\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"h\\preceq s","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi=(T,\\lambda,a)","display":false},{"tex":"a_h","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod_{j\\in[k]\\setminus\\{\\lambda(h)\\}}X_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"t_\\Pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi\\in\\mathscr P_{k,n}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"L(T)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in T:h0\\notin T\\land h1\\notin T\\},\\qquad J(T)\\coloneqq T\\setminus L(T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathscr P_{k,n}\\coloneqq\\{(T,\\lambda,a):\\;&T\\subseteq\\Sigma^{<\\omega},\\ |T|<\\aleph_0,\\ \\epsilon\\in T\\setminus L(T),\\ \\forall s\\in T\\ \\forall h\\preceq s\\ h\\in T,\\\\\n&\\forall h\\in J(T)\\ \\{h0,h1\\}\\subseteq T,\\ \\lambda:J(T)\\to[k],\\ a\\in\\prod_{h\\in J(T)}\\Sigma^{\\prod_{j\\in[k]\\setminus\\{\\lambda(h)\\}}X_j}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"h_0^{\\Pi,x}\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad h_{t+1}^{\\Pi,x}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}h_t^{\\Pi,x}&h_t^{\\Pi,x}\\in L(T),\\\\h_t^{\\Pi,x}a_{h_t^{\\Pi,x}}(x_{-\\lambda(h_t^{\\Pi,x})})&h_t^{\\Pi,x}\\in J(T).\\end{cases}\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad t_\\Pi(x)\\coloneqq\\min\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:h_t^{\\Pi,x}\\in L(T)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"C_k(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\max_{x\\in\\Omega}t_\\Pi(x):\\Pi\\in\\mathscr P_{k,n},\\ \\forall x\\in\\Omega\\ (h_{t_\\Pi(x)}^{\\Pi,x})_{t_\\Pi(x)}=f(x)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_i\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq\\Omega:\\forall x\\in S\\ \\forall z\\in X_i\\ (x_1,\\ldots,x_{i-1},z,x_{i+1},\\ldots,x_k)\\in S\\}\\quad(i\\in[k]),\\qquad\\mathcal{CI}\\coloneqq\\{\\bigcap_{i=1}^kS_i:S_i\\in\\mathcal C_i\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":3172,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-345","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-communication-matrix]]、[[28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle]]、[[28-thm-communication-rank-lower-bound]]、[[28-df-discrepancy]]、[[28-thm-discrepancy-communication-bound]]、[[28-df-number-on-forehead]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}